 "notes": "p. 91 rows 1-4 = Chapter LXI (line numerals 1. at start of row 1, 2. before per in row 2); stopped at the short rule before 'Appendix.'. p. 94 rows 1-6 skipped as Appendix (they are LXIII B 'not being scalded with water'). Chapter LIV: 1. at start of p. 94 row 7; 2. stands in row 8 before āāt (last word on p. 94); 3. before utā (p. 95 row 2); 4. before à 'Hail' (p. 95 row 3, end). So LIV line 2 covers āāt through nuk on p. 95. Overlines: p. 91 row 1 over Re en tem erṭāt neḥem-tu, and a separate short overline over mā-f only; p. 91 row 2 over t'eṭ àn (not Àusàr); p. 94 row 7 over Re en erṭāt nifu em (ends above em, not Neter-χert), and over t'eṭ àn (not Àusàr). No overlines on p. 95. Square brackets p. 95: row 1 around the A1 after neχeχt; row 2 around the A40 between aāb and rer-nà; row 3 around the whole peḥti group. Budge's English glosses given as printed; 'Saith' covers t'eṭ àn so àn has empty gloss; p. 95 row 3 en has no separate English (his 'his egg' spans en suḥt-f)."
